 "topics": [
  {
   "key": "greeting",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "{Gunfight started, no Trudy help} Are you trying to get my saloon shot up? Finish what you started!",
     "emotion": "anger",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "{Gunfight started, Trudy help} Keep an eye out. This isn't finished yet.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Well, you've been causing quite a stir. Glad I finally got to meet you. Welcome to the Prospector Saloon.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "So, you're planning on taking on Joe Cobb's gang. It's a big risk, but I suppose you have to do what you think is right.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "I hope you didn't just bring a heap of trouble down on Goodsprings by killing Joe Cobb like that.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "His friends might come looking for him, and I don't think they're going to care who was involved in his death or not.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Well, what's done is done. So, uh, what can I do for you?",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "I'm glad that business is over. I like it when Goodsprings is nice and quiet.",
     "emotion": "happy",
     "intensity": 10
    },
    {
     "text": "Feeling thirsty? I can take care of that.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
