  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic000",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Mostly traders looking to buy Bighorner meat and hides. The traders are the main reason the general store manages to stay in business.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Most travelers heading south on in the I-15 just push on towards Primm unless they're in desperate need of supplies.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic000",
   "prompt": "Does Goodsprings get many visitors?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic001",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "[SUCCEEDED] I was planning on sitting this one out, but for some reason I can't help but like you. I'm with you.",
     "emotion": "happy",
     "intensity": 10
    },
    {
     "text": "Let me have a word with a few other folks and I'll see if I can't round up some more members for this militia you're creating.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "While everyone does own a gun, we could stand to be a little better equipped. The general store probably has what we need in stock.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic001",
   "prompt": "You should help me take down the powder gang. Bullets, explosions, lots of fun.",
