  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic002",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "He's a convict. Just without the chains. Said his name was Cobb. \"Powder Gangers\" is what they call themselves. Plenty more like him out there.",
     "emotion": "anger",
     "intensity": 5
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic002",
   "prompt": "Who was that man you were arguing with?",
   "next": [
    "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic016"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic003",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "There's always something interesting going on, but the biggest news has to be the coming dustup between the NCR and the Legion over the Dam.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic003",
   "prompt": "Anything interesting going on in the rest of the wasteland?",
   "next": [
    "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic005",
    "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic006",
    "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic007"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic004",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "They were having some kind of argument about it, but the guy in the checkered coat kept shushing them.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Sounded like they came in from the north through Quarry Junction. If that's the case I can't say I blame them for not wanting to go back.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic004",
   "prompt": "Did my attackers say where they were going?",
   "next": [
    "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic014",
    "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic015"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic005",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "The New California Republic's got the most power in Nevada. Money, troops, you name it.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "They do what they can to keep things safe in the region, but if you ask me, they're trying to do too much. They're spread too thin.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic005",
   "prompt": "Tell me about the NCR."
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic006",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "{disgust mixed with fear} Slavers, killers, and all other kinds of trouble. They dress up like Roman soldiers, so there's no mistaking it when you see them.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "The rumor is that the Legion is far larger than the NCR lets on, and that it's been due to luck that the Legion hasn't overrun the territory.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic006",
   "prompt": "What can you tell me about the Legion?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic007",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "I'm pretty sure the NCR wants to hold onto the Dam because it's one of the few places around that can make electricity.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "The Legion are a bunch of savages, though. No idea why they'd want the Dam. Probably plan on destroying it or something.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic007",
   "prompt": "Why do you think the NCR and the Legion both want the Dam?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic012",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Not much, other than they're a bunch of freeloaders who expected a few rounds on the house. I was able to get them to pay up, though.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Of course, one of the Great Khans did knock my radio to the floor \"by accident,\" and it hasn't been working since.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic012",
   "prompt": "I'm trying to track down the people who attacked me. Know anything about them?",
   "next": [
    "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic004"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic013",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "I know that... thing... as much as anyone else around here. It mostly keeps to itself, which is just fine by me. {thing said with a measure of disgust.}",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "{Victor dead} Good riddance to it is all I have to say. Never liked having it around.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic013",
   "prompt": "Do you know the robot that rescued me?",
   "next": [
    "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic022",
    "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic023"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic014",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "That whole area's overrun with the kind of critters that just get mad if you shoot 'em.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Merchants avoid that whole stretch of I-15 like it's radioactive. Which it could be for all I know.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic014",
   "prompt": "Why is that?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic015",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "I didn't hear exactly, but the leader was talking about the Strip.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Fella wants to get there and avoid the 15, he'd have to go east. Take Highway 93 up.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic015",
   "prompt": "So where were they headed?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic016",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Chain gangs, really. The NCR brought them in from California to work on the rail lines.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Problem is, it turns out that giving convicts a bunch of dynamite and blasting powder isn't the best idea.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Was a big escape not too long ago. Some of 'em stuck together so they could make trouble. That's what we're dealing with now.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic016",
   "prompt": "Powder gangers?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic017",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Sure. The outside looks okay, but I think something broke on the inside.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "There'd be caps in it for you. I do like to hear what's going on in the world. And that Mr. New Vegas seems like such a gentleman.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic017",
   "prompt": "Want me to take a look at your broken radio?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic018",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Yep, I heard it turn right back on after you got done tinkering with it. Here's some caps for the work.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic018",
   "prompt": "I fixed your radio."
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic020",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "You're welcome. So, can I get you anything?",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic020",
   "prompt": "Thanks for the caps."
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic022",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Other than rolling around once in awhile, it doesn't do anything useful as far as I can tell.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "I don't know why it took an interest in you, but I'd be careful. It's never helped anyone before.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic022",
   "prompt": "What does he actually do around here?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic023",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "It acts friendly enough, but I don't trust that whole \"cheerful cowboy\" act. I find it all very creepy.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic023",
   "prompt": "You don't like him?",
   "next": [
    "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic026"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic024",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Fine by me.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic024",
   "prompt": "Never mind. Let's talk about something else."
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic025",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "All right.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic025",
   "prompt": "Never mind. I want to talk about something else."
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic026",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "It was here when I took over the saloon seven years ago. Some people have said its owner lived here, but no one knows who it was.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic026",
   "prompt": "How long has he been in Goodsprings?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic027",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "If you were able to get Ringo out of this mess, you'd have a decent reputation around Goodsprings. I'd even set you up with a discount.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Of course, helping Ringo would also make the Powder Gangers mad, and they've got a {emphasize \"lot\"} lot of friends out there.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic027",
   "prompt": "What happens if I help Ringo?",
   "next": [
    "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic028"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic028",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "{slight anger - player just asked about helping criminals} Don't know why you'd want to go do a thing like that. Yeah, you'd get on their good side, but people around here wouldn't appreciate it one bit.",
     "emotion": "anger",
     "intensity": 5
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic028",
   "prompt": "So I help Ringo, and Goodsprings will like me more. What if I help the Powder Gangers?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic029",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "[SUCCEEDED] Not at all! I'm never sure how much is normally charged for this sort of thing. Here's some additional caps - that should be enough.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Now, how about spending some of those caps in the saloon?",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic029",
   "prompt": "That's it? Are you implying that I've done shoddy work?",
   "label": "< Barter 20 >"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic029_2",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "[FAILED] I could get another working radio with the caps I already gave you. Now, how about spending some of those caps right now?",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic029",
   "prompt": "That's all? I think you could afford to pay me a little more.",
   "label": "< Barter 20 >"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgstrudytopic030",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "[SUCCEEDED] That does sound like a good plan. All right, you seem to know what you're doing, so you can count me in.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Let me have a word with a few other folks and I'll see if I can't round up some more members for this militia you're creating.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "While everyone does own a gun, we could stand to be a little better equipped. The general store probably has what we need in stock.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSTrudyTopic030",
