  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgoodspringsrubytopic000",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "It looks like our little town got itself dragged into the middle of something we don't want anything to do with.",
     "emotion": "disgust",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "About a week ago, this trader, Ringo, comes into town. Survivor of an attack, he says. Bad men after him, needs a place to hide.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "We figured he was just in shock, so we gave him a place to lie low. We didn't actually expect anyone to come after him.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
